   "offered_by": {
    "codex": "adeptus_mechanicus"
   },
   "text": "Restrictions\n\n- Your army must include a Skitarii Marshal.\n- Your army must include 2 units of either Skitarii Vanguard or Skitarii Rangers in any combination.\n- Your army must include at least 1 Kataphron Battle Servitor unit.\n- Your army must include at least 1 Kastelan Battle Automata unit.\n\nBenefits\n\n- A Skitarii Marshal may select 2 different units for the Doctrina Imperative special rule in your Movement Phase.\n- Kataphron Battle Servitors ignore the Support Squad special rule.\n- Skitarii Infantry units in your army may purchase Frag Grenades for 5pts.",
