  {
   "id": "codex/adeptus_mechanicus/rites_of_war/infiltration_clade",
   "name": "Infiltration Clade",
   "page": 22,
   "url": "https://longwarindex.app/rites_of_war/infiltration_clade/",
   "offered_by": {
    "codex": "adeptus_mechanicus"
   },
   "text": "Restrictions\n\n- Your army must include at least 1 unit of Sicarian Infiltrators or Sicarian Ruststalkers.\n- Your army must include at least 1 Ironstrider Ballistarii.\n- Your army may not include any units with the Vehicle type.\n\nBenefits\n\n- You may field Sicarian Infiltrators as Troops choices.\n- You may field Sicarian Ruststalkers as Troops choices.\n- You may field Archeopter Transvectors as Dedicated Transports.",
